## Explore Under the Hood

This section, 'This Website is <u>One</u> Single Guide', is a single step from the documentation's opening map. To see the mechanics behind it, click the ancillary button in the right margin labeled 'Show this step...'.

An ancillary is how [Docs Assembler](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=netoftrees.documentation-assembler) keeps guides clean. It lets you expand detailed information—like source code or context—on demand, keeping the main path focused for readers who don't need the extra detail.

Clicking it opens a panel showing a screenshot of this step as it's built in [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/). From there, use the ancillary buttons within the panel to drill down and explore the interconnected structure for yourself.

